{"seq":1,"slug":"character-controller-states","title":"角色控制器状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/character-controller-states","wordCount":744,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"角色控制器状态\">角色控制器状态</h1><p>角色控制器是玩家直接感知游戏「手感」的核心系统，其背后的状态机设计直接决定了控制的响应性、流畅性和准确性。本文以典型平台跳跃游戏的角色为例，深入讲解角色控制器状态集的设计与实现，重点覆盖缓冲输入、coyote time 等影响手感的关键机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>角色控制器状态机将玩家可执行的所有行为抽象为有限的离散状态，每个状态定义了该状态下允许的行为、物理参数和动画切换逻辑。状态机确保同一时刻只有一种「行为模式」处于激活状态，消除了复杂 if-else 链中常见的边缘情况 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"典型状态集设计\">典型状态集设计</h2><p>一个完整的动作游戏角色控制器至少需要以下状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Idle&#10;&#10;    Idle --&gt; Walking: 有移动输入&#10;    Walking --&gt; Idle: 无移动输入&#10;    Walking --&gt; Running: Sprint 键按下&#10;    Running --&gt; Walking: Sprint 键松开&#10;&#10;    Idle --&gt; Jumping: Jump 键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面&#10;    Walking --&gt; Jumping: Jump 键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面&#10;    Running --&gt; Jumping: Jump 键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面&#10;&#10;    Jumping --&gt; Falling: 垂直速度 &lt;= 0&#10;    Falling --&gt; Idle: 落地检测&#10;    Falling --&gt; Jumping: (二段跳,可选)&#10;&#10;    Idle --&gt; Attacking: 攻击键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面&#10;    Walking --&gt; Attacking: 攻击键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面&#10;    Attacking --&gt; Idle: 攻击动画完成&#10;&#10;    Idle --&gt; Hit: 受到伤害&#10;    Walking --&gt; Hit: 受到伤害&#10;    Running --&gt; Hit: 受到伤害&#10;    Hit --&gt; Idle: 硬直结束&#10;&#10;    Idle --&gt; Dead: HP &lt;= 0&#10;    Walking --&gt; Dead: HP &lt;= 0&#10;    Attacking --&gt; Dead: HP &lt;= 0\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Idle\n\n    Idle --&gt; Walking: 有移动输入\n    Walking --&gt; Idle: 无移动输入\n    Walking --&gt; Running: Sprint 键按下\n    Running --&gt; Walking: Sprint 键松开\n\n    Idle --&gt; Jumping: Jump 键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面\n    Walking --&gt; Jumping: Jump 键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面\n    Running --&gt; Jumping: Jump 键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面\n\n    Jumping --&gt; Falling: 垂直速度 &lt;= 0\n    Falling --&gt; Idle: 落地检测\n    Falling --&gt; Jumping: (二段跳,可选)\n\n    Idle --&gt; Attacking: 攻击键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面\n    Walking --&gt; Attacking: 攻击键按下 &amp;&amp; 在地面\n    Attacking --&gt; Idle: 攻击动画完成\n\n    Idle --&gt; Hit: 受到伤害\n    Walking --&gt; Hit: 受到伤害\n    Running --&gt; Hit: 受到伤害\n    Hit --&gt; Idle: 硬直结束\n\n    Idle --&gt; Dead: HP &lt;= 0\n    Walking --&gt; Dead: HP &lt;= 0\n    Attacking --&gt; Dead: HP &lt;= 0</pre><p><strong>状态优先级</strong>（高优先级转换覆盖低优先级）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Dead</td>\n<td>任何时候 HP≤0 立即触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>Hit</td>\n<td>受到伤害触发硬直</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Falling</td>\n<td>检测到不在地面时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Jumping</td>\n<td>跳跃起始帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Attacking</td>\n<td>攻击逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Running</td>\n<td>Sprint + 移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Walking</td>\n<td>有移动输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Idle</td>\n<td>默认状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输入缓冲机制\">输入缓冲机制</h2><p>**输入缓冲（Input Buffering）**是角色控制器手感的关键技术。玩家在动作完成前稍微提前按键（如在攻击动画结束前 0.1 秒按下跳跃），游戏应该「记住」这个输入并在条件满足时立即执行，而不是丢弃它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class InputBuffer&#10;{&#10;    private struct BufferedInput&#10;    {&#10;        public string ActionName;&#10;        public float Timestamp;&#10;        public float MaxBufferTime;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private Queue&lt;BufferedInput&gt; buffer = new Queue&lt;BufferedInput&gt;();&#10;&#10;    // 注册一个输入&#10;    public void RegisterInput(string action, float bufferDuration = 0.15f)&#10;    {&#10;        buffer.Enqueue(new BufferedInput&#10;        {&#10;            ActionName = action,&#10;            Timestamp = Time.time,&#10;            MaxBufferTime = bufferDuration&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 检查是否有有效的缓冲输入&#10;    public bool ConsumeInput(string action)&#10;    {&#10;        // 清理过期输入&#10;        while (buffer.Count &gt; 0&#10;               &amp;&amp; Time.time - buffer.Peek().Timestamp &gt; buffer.Peek().MaxBufferTime)&#10;            buffer.Dequeue();&#10;&#10;        // 查找目标输入&#10;        var items = buffer.ToList();&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; items.Count; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            if (items[i].ActionName == action)&#10;            {&#10;                // 消费此输入（重建队列，排除该元素）&#10;                buffer = new Queue&lt;BufferedInput&gt;(&#10;                    items.Where((_, idx) =&gt; idx != i));&#10;                return true;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return false;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在输入处理中注册&#10;private void ProcessInput()&#10;{&#10;    if (Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Jump&quot;))&#10;        inputBuffer.RegisterInput(&quot;Jump&quot;, bufferDuration: 0.12f);&#10;&#10;    if (Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Attack&quot;))&#10;        inputBuffer.RegisterInput(&quot;Attack&quot;, bufferDuration: 0.1f);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在 Attacking 状态的 OnUpdate 末尾检查缓冲跳跃&#10;public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)&#10;{&#10;    // 检查是否已完成攻击&#10;    if (attackAnimComplete)&#10;    {&#10;        if (player.InputBuffer.ConsumeInput(&quot;Jump&quot;))&#10;            player.FSM.ChangeState&lt;JumpState&gt;(); // 缓冲输入生效&#10;        else&#10;            player.FSM.ChangeState&lt;IdleState&gt;();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class InputBuffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private struct BufferedInput</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public string ActionName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public float Timestamp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public float MaxBufferTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Queue&#x3C;BufferedInput> buffer = new Queue&#x3C;BufferedInput>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 注册一个输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void RegisterInput(string action, float bufferDuration = 0.15f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        buffer.Enqueue(new BufferedInput</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ActionName = action,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Timestamp = Time.time,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            MaxBufferTime = bufferDuration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 检查是否有有效的缓冲输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public bool ConsumeInput(string action)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 清理过期输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (buffer.Count > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               &#x26;&#x26; Time.time - buffer.Peek().Timestamp > buffer.Peek().MaxBufferTime)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buffer.Dequeue();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 查找目标输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var items = buffer.ToList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; items.Count; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (items[i].ActionName == action)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 消费此输入（重建队列，排除该元素）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                buffer = new Queue&#x3C;BufferedInput>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    items.Where((_, idx) => idx != i));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在输入处理中注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>private void ProcessInput()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (Input.GetButtonDown(\"Jump\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        inputBuffer.RegisterInput(\"Jump\", bufferDuration: 0.12f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (Input.GetButtonDown(\"Attack\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        inputBuffer.RegisterInput(\"Attack\", bufferDuration: 0.1f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 Attacking 状态的 OnUpdate 末尾检查缓冲跳跃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 检查是否已完成攻击</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (attackAnimComplete)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (player.InputBuffer.ConsumeInput(\"Jump\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.FSM.ChangeState&#x3C;JumpState>(); // 缓冲输入生效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.FSM.ChangeState&#x3C;IdleState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"coyote-time-土狼时间\">Coyote Time（土狼时间）</h2><p><strong>Coyote Time</strong> 是平台跳跃游戏中最重要的手感优化技术之一，名称来自卡通土狼在悬崖边跑空后短暂漂浮再下落的场景。实现方式：角色走过平台边缘后，在极短时间内（0.1-0.2 秒）仍然允许跳跃，而不是立即进入 Falling 状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class FallingState : PlayerStateBase&#10;{&#10;    private const float COYOTE_DURATION = 0.15f;&#10;    private float coyoteTimer;&#10;    private bool coyoteUsed;&#10;&#10;    public override void OnEnter(PlayerController player)&#10;    {&#10;        // 刚离开地面，重置 coyote 计时器&#10;        if (player.WasGroundedLastFrame)&#10;        {&#10;            coyoteTimer = COYOTE_DURATION;&#10;            coyoteUsed = false;&#10;        }&#10;        else&#10;        {&#10;            // 从跳跃进入 Falling，无 coyote 时间&#10;            coyoteTimer = 0f;&#10;            coyoteUsed = true;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)&#10;    {&#10;        coyoteTimer -= Time.deltaTime;&#10;&#10;        // Coyote 跳跃机会&#10;        if (!coyoteUsed &amp;&amp; coyoteTimer &gt; 0&#10;            &amp;&amp; player.InputBuffer.ConsumeInput(&quot;Jump&quot;))&#10;        {&#10;            coyoteUsed = true;&#10;            player.FSM.ChangeState&lt;JumpState&gt;();&#10;            return;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 落地检测&#10;        if (player.GroundChecker.IsGrounded)&#10;        {&#10;            player.FSM.ChangeState&lt;LandState&gt;();&#10;            return;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 重力加速&#10;        player.Rigidbody.AddForce(&#10;            Vector3.down * player.Config.FallMultiplier, ForceMode.Acceleration);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class FallingState : PlayerStateBase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private const float COYOTE_DURATION = 0.15f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float coyoteTimer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool coyoteUsed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 刚离开地面，重置 coyote 计时器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (player.WasGroundedLastFrame)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            coyoteTimer = COYOTE_DURATION;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            coyoteUsed = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 从跳跃进入 Falling，无 coyote 时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            coyoteTimer = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            coyoteUsed = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coyoteTimer -= Time.deltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Coyote 跳跃机会</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!coyoteUsed &#x26;&#x26; coyoteTimer > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x26;&#x26; player.InputBuffer.ConsumeInput(\"Jump\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            coyoteUsed = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.FSM.ChangeState&#x3C;JumpState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 落地检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (player.GroundChecker.IsGrounded)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.FSM.ChangeState&#x3C;LandState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 重力加速</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        player.Rigidbody.AddForce(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Vector3.down * player.Config.FallMultiplier, ForceMode.Acceleration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"跳跃状态的精细控制\">跳跃状态的精细控制</h2><p>跳跃是动作游戏手感的核心，几个关键优化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class JumpState : PlayerStateBase&#10;{&#10;    // 可变高度跳跃：按键时间越长，跳越高&#10;    private bool jumpButtonHeld;&#10;&#10;    public override void OnEnter(PlayerController player)&#10;    {&#10;        player.Rigidbody.velocity = new Vector3(&#10;            player.Rigidbody.velocity.x,&#10;            player.Config.JumpForce,&#10;            player.Rigidbody.velocity.z);&#10;&#10;        player.Animator.SetTrigger(&quot;Jump&quot;);&#10;        jumpButtonHeld = true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)&#10;    {&#10;        // 可变跳跃高度：松开跳跃键时削减上升力&#10;        if (jumpButtonHeld &amp;&amp; Input.GetButtonUp(&quot;Jump&quot;))&#10;        {&#10;            jumpButtonHeld = false;&#10;            if (player.Rigidbody.velocity.y &gt; 0)&#10;            {&#10;                player.Rigidbody.velocity = new Vector3(&#10;                    player.Rigidbody.velocity.x,&#10;                    player.Rigidbody.velocity.y * 0.5f,&#10;                    player.Rigidbody.velocity.z);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 上升到顶点后切换到 Falling&#10;        if (player.Rigidbody.velocity.y &lt;= 0)&#10;            player.FSM.ChangeState&lt;FallingState&gt;();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class JumpState : PlayerStateBase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 可变高度跳跃：按键时间越长，跳越高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool jumpButtonHeld;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        player.Rigidbody.velocity = new Vector3(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.Rigidbody.velocity.x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.Config.JumpForce,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.Rigidbody.velocity.z);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        player.Animator.SetTrigger(\"Jump\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        jumpButtonHeld = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 可变跳跃高度：松开跳跃键时削减上升力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (jumpButtonHeld &#x26;&#x26; Input.GetButtonUp(\"Jump\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            jumpButtonHeld = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (player.Rigidbody.velocity.y > 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                player.Rigidbody.velocity = new Vector3(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    player.Rigidbody.velocity.x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    player.Rigidbody.velocity.y * 0.5f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    player.Rigidbody.velocity.z);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 上升到顶点后切换到 Falling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (player.Rigidbody.velocity.y &#x3C;= 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            player.FSM.ChangeState&#x3C;FallingState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"攻击连段与攻击取消\">攻击连段与攻击取消</h2><p>格斗类游戏中，攻击往往有连段逻辑：在第一段攻击的「取消窗口」内按下攻击键，连接第二段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class AttackState : PlayerStateBase&#10;{&#10;    private int comboCount = 0;&#10;    private bool comboQueued = false;&#10;    private bool inCancelWindow = false;&#10;&#10;    private readonly int[] comboAttackHashes = new int[]&#10;    {&#10;        Animator.StringToHash(&quot;Attack1&quot;),&#10;        Animator.StringToHash(&quot;Attack2&quot;),&#10;        Animator.StringToHash(&quot;Attack3&quot;)&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    public override void OnEnter(PlayerController player)&#10;    {&#10;        player.Animator.SetTrigger($&quot;Attack{comboCount + 1}&quot;);&#10;        inCancelWindow = false;&#10;        comboQueued = false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 由动画事件调用，标记进入取消窗口&#10;    public void OnEnterCancelWindow()&#10;    {&#10;        inCancelWindow = true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 由动画事件调用，标记取消窗口结束&#10;    public void OnExitCancelWindow()&#10;    {&#10;        inCancelWindow = false;&#10;&#10;        if (comboQueued &amp;&amp; comboCount &lt; 2)&#10;        {&#10;            comboCount++;&#10;            owner.FSM.ChangeState&lt;AttackState&gt;(); // 重新进入，触发下一段&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)&#10;    {&#10;        if (inCancelWindow &amp;&amp; Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Attack&quot;))&#10;        {&#10;            comboQueued = true;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnExit(PlayerController player)&#10;    {&#10;        if (!comboQueued)&#10;            comboCount = 0; // 连段中断，重置计数&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class AttackState : PlayerStateBase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int comboCount = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool comboQueued = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool inCancelWindow = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly int[] comboAttackHashes = new int[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Animator.StringToHash(\"Attack1\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Animator.StringToHash(\"Attack2\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Animator.StringToHash(\"Attack3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnEnter(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        player.Animator.SetTrigger($\"Attack{comboCount + 1}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        inCancelWindow = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        comboQueued = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 由动画事件调用，标记进入取消窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnEnterCancelWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        inCancelWindow = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 由动画事件调用，标记取消窗口结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnExitCancelWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        inCancelWindow = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (comboQueued &#x26;&#x26; comboCount &#x3C; 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            comboCount++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            owner.FSM.ChangeState&#x3C;AttackState>(); // 重新进入，触发下一段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (inCancelWindow &#x26;&#x26; Input.GetButtonDown(\"Attack\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            comboQueued = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnExit(PlayerController player)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!comboQueued)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            comboCount = 0; // 连段中断，重置计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>角色控制器状态机的质量直接影响游戏手感。输入缓冲消除了「明明按了没反应」的挫败感，coyote time 让平台跳跃更宽容，可变高度跳跃和攻击连段让技能曲线更丰富。核心原则：状态转换要明确优先级，边缘情况要有明确处理，手感调优靠参数（缓冲时长、coyote 时长）而不是改结构。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"animation-state-machines\">动画状态机</a> — 角色控制器状态如何驱动动画系统的切换</li>\n<li><a href=\"game-flow-management\">游戏流程管理</a> — 宏观游戏状态（Pause/GameOver）如何影响角色控制器</li>\n<li><a href=\"../fundamentals/fsm-design-patterns\">有限状态机设计模式</a> — 角色控制器状态机的底层模式与三元组设计</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"角色控制器状态","id":"角色控制器状态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"典型状态集设计","id":"典型状态集设计"},{"level":2,"text":"输入缓冲机制","id":"输入缓冲机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Coyote Time（土狼时间）","id":"coyote-time-土狼时间"},{"level":2,"text":"跳跃状态的精细控制","id":"跳跃状态的精细控制"},{"level":2,"text":"攻击连段与攻击取消","id":"攻击连段与攻击取消"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"效用系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/utility-ai"},"next":{"title":"动画状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/animation-state-machines"}}